    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "A320\nSAFETY INFORMATION\nIf you are seated in an exit seat and do not understand\nspoken English or the information contained in this\nsafety card, please notify one of our employees.\nSi usted está sentado en una fila de salida y no entiende\ninglés o la información en esta tarjeta de seguridad,\ncomuniquese con uno de nuestros empleados.\nPlease do not remove this card from airplane.\nPor favor, deje esta tarjeta en el avión.\nFollow these instructions, the directions of crew members,\nand placarded signs.\nW AMERICA WEST AIRLINES®\nA320",
      "NO SMOKING\nNo fumar\nNO SMOKING\nNo smoking\nat any time.\nOXYGEN\nOxigeno\nSEAT BELTS\nCinturones de seguridad\nFASTEN SEAT BELT\nFasten seat belt and\nremain seated while\nthis sign is illuminated.\n2\nOVERHEAD COMPARTMENTS\nOK\n...\nWe recommend that you\nkeep your seat belt fastened\nat all times when seated.\nDO NOT USE\n3\nNo utilizar\nTAKE OFF/LANDING\nSAFETY INFORMATION\nA320",
      "#961940\nCopyright © America West Airlines\n12/00 printed in U.S.A."
